  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0087_906796962006.png\" style=\"width: 232px; height: 220px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>The point of intersection of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Area&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn